## Prerequisites

```bash
# Rust, if you do not have it
curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | sh

# The contract build target
rustup target add {% rust_target %}

# The Stellar CLI
cargo install --locked stellar-cli@{% stellar_cli_version %}
```

`rust-toolchain.toml` pins the toolchain and target, so `rustup` will usually
install the target for you on first build.

## Test

Tests run natively against an in-memory host, so no network or deployment is
involved:

```bash
cargo test
```

